CM Transmission line Test
CM spacing set to minimum seg-length for 40m
CM feedline radius optimized to get 460 ohms
CE 
SY fr = 7.05		
SY wl = 299.8/fr	
SY min = wl/999		
SY max = 4.95*min	
'
SY rad = .00097 	
SY dis = min		
SY len = 20		
SY nrs = len/max	
'
GW	1	nrs	-dis/2	0	1	-dis/2	0	len+1	rad	
GW 	2	nrs	dis/2	0	len+1	dis/2	0	1 	rad	
'
GW	10	1	-dis/2	0	1	dis/2	0	1	rad	
GW	11	1	-dis/2	0	len+1	dis/2	0	len+1	rad	
'
GE 1
'
GN 2 0 0 0 14 .006		
FR 0 1 0 0 fr 1
'
EX 0 10 1 0 1 0			
'
SY r = 460
LD 0 11 1 0 r 0 0		
'
